/v1/","context":{"app_id":4838990,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4838990-1846651706684243","game_id":"steam-4838990","kind":"announcement","title":"Name change!","summary":"Hello everyone :)Over the last 2 months, I've read a lot of feedback on the game. A lot of you seem to like it, which is really nice to hear (and actually, pretty much no bugs, which is perfect!).But there seems to be some confusion with the name, implying that there will be a lot of randomness, dice thrown around everywhere, dice with multiple different faces etc...And to be honest, you're right! At the beginning of this journey back in March, it actually did! But as I progressed with the game'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:16:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838990-1844751498233626","game_id":"steam-4838990","kind":"update","title":"Big demo update!","summary":"Hey everyone!One month ago I release the first demo for Dice Factory. And a lot of you played it!So first of all thank you to everyone who tried the game!It didn't have a lot of bugs but it was missing some keys features and other things were annoying. So I revamped a few aspects to prepare for the Next Steam Fest in October.There are now two dice types, the 6 sided and 4 sided. The 6 sided one is still for the workers, nothing changed. But the 4 sided, pyramide one, is for all the other dice. T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T09:04:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233626","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838990-1842212951305662","game_id":"steam-4838990","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is live!","summary":"Hey everyone!I'm really glad I can finally release the demo of my really cool city-building game!I worked quite hard over the last few months in order to shape up Dice Factory.First of all, thank you to everyone who played during the latest Playtest, it gave me a lot of feedback. The game is ever better now because of you!I plan to release the main game later this year. There is still a tiny bit of work to do of course, but in the meantime enjoy the demo, give me all your feedback so we can make","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T13:58:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838990-1841579228673814","game_id":"steam-4838990","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you!","summary":"Hello everyone!I want to thank everybody who played in the first Playtest of Dice Factory!I gathered a lot of data about what was good and bad, it will take me a few days to go through everything and be ready for the next step... the demo !I'll post some news about it in the upcoming days :)Stay tuned!mrTodo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T18:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838990-1841579228663665","game_id":"steam-4838990","kind":"announcement","title":"First Playtest is coming!","summary":"Hello everyone!After months of work and testing, I'm really excited to show my game, Dice Factory to everyone !I'll need your feedback next weekend on my first playtest.Starting Friday 21 at 7pm CET (the countdown) lasting until the same time Sunday.You will be able to play the full game no restriction!(There are still some content that is missing ; but clearly there are no bugs ?! :D)For the feedback don't hesitate to jump on my discord, I answer quite quickly and I really listen to all your fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T20:24:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4838990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4838990":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4838990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5144270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4838990","app_id":4838990,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3a9847b76db7160d08a14154b19d73b6140daf2b0a846e9b263dfcf6fa2b8234","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Cube Duty는 큐브를 던질 때마다 경제와 전장이 변화하는 물리 기반 도시 건설 게임입니다. 모든 큐브는 건물, 자원 또는 유닛이 될 수 있습니다. Worker Cube를 Archery로 굴려 Archers를 모집하고 생산망을 확장해 강력한 보스와 적으로부터 왕국을 지키세요!","publishers":[{"name":"mrTodo","creator_clan_account_id":45070970}]